DESCRIPTION:Jay Badlani  is a stand-up comedian\, writer\, and actor based
  in Atlanta\, GA. Known for his unflinching attitude and sharp\, charismati
 c voice\, Jay has built one of the more impressive digital followings in th
 e independent comedy space\, with over 200 million views and 200\,000+ foll
 owers across his platforms through a steady output of live stand-up and onl
 ine content.\n\nA regular at the Laughing Skull Lounge\, Jay is a fixture o
 f the Atlanta comedy scene while simultaneously headlining rooms across the
  country. Recent and ongoing performances have taken him to Mic Drop Comedy
  in Arizona\, The Lincoln Lodge in Chicago\, and various Don't Tell Comedy 
 showcases\, alongside a recurring series of his own\, Jay Badlani and Frien
 ds\, which he produces and headlines in Atlanta.\n\nA respected festival pr
 esence\, Jay is an alumnus of the Laughing Skull Comedy Festival\, Red Clay
  Fest\, Rogue Island Comedy Festival\, and the North Carolina Comedy Festiv
 al. He has shared the stage with Jeff Garlin\, Clayton English\, and Dina H
 ashem.\n\nThere is a two-item per person minimum in the Showroom\, which ca
 n be fulfilled with any food or drink items from the menu.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: 
